      hu: "A Pearl of Africa Hotel egy történelmi hotel Kampalában, Kololo negyedben. 1953-ban épült, 60 szobával. Diplomáciai és üzleti találkozók helyszíne. Gyarmati stílusú, modern felszereltséggel. Medence, étterem, konferenciatermek. 2008-ban felújították. Uganda becenevéről kapta a nevét, ‘Afrika gyöngye’. Szobaárak 100-300 USD között.",
      ro: "Hotelul Pearl of Africa este un hotel istoric in Kampala, Uganda. Construit in 1953, situat in cartierul Kololo. Are 60 de camere si suite. A fost loc de intalnire pentru diplomati si oameni de afaceri. Stil colonial, cu facilitati moderne. Piscina, restaurant, sali de conferinte. Renovat in 2008. Numit dupa porecla Ugandei, ‘Perla Africii’. Tarife camere intre 100 si 300 USD pe noapte.",
      en: "The Pearl of Africa Hotel is a historic hotel located in Kampala's Kololo neighborhood. Built in 1953, it features 60 rooms and suites. The hotel has served as a hub for diplomats and business travelers. It blends colonial architecture with modern amenities, including a swimming pool, restaurant, and conference facilities. Renovated in 2008, the hotel is named after Uganda's nickname, 'Pearl of Africa'. Room rates range from $100 to $300 per night. It remains a popular venue for conferences and events.",
